WEBVTT

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:15.940
On that cold night, I came to realize

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:20.920
that there's a place deeper down
that hurts even more than injuries

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:26.150
In this world painted with lies

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:30.760
where it's not clear what's true anymore

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.660
I wanted to keep you safe

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:40.800
The moment that
distortion and love overlapped,

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:48.880
the wind embraced the
sadness that had closed in

00:00:48.880 --> 00:01:00.190
I'll never forget your sole voice
that continues to echo through the sky

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:09.030
The prayer is going to melt
away and disappear, just like snow

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:13.670
Today, I'll increase my speed again

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:17.770
as I search for the reason for living

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:29.170
even if I can't be a hero just yet

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:36.990
The idea of someone with that
much power leaving their control

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.830
and making enemies out of everything...

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:41.700
People are very foolish,

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:46.840
so they think "killers" are more
suited for this world than "killees."

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:53.210
But the "killers" don't realize what they are

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:56.180
until they've killed everything.

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:01.450
But now I understand.

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:04.820
He didn't want me to
get caught up in the fighting.

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:09.490
You bring misfortune to everything you touch!

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:11.320
You're a devil!

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:45.120
These are...

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:50.660
So it really was Al...

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:01.240
This is where he...

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:25.970
Who do I pray to for Brad,
Al, and everyone who died?

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:29.270
I find it hard to believe there's a God now.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:38.480
We'll carry their spirits with us.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:41.940
Yes, we will.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.680
What's that?!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.900
Let's get outta here, Amanda!

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.740
It's too late for that.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:04.040
You're gonna fight?!

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.010
Against that many?

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:12.110
Don't move.

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:26.390
If they wanted to kill us,
they could've done so long ago.

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:53.690
It's almost like a legion of the underworld...

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:56.520
Where did all those Demoniacs come from?

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:04.530
It looks like they have no interest in us.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.730
Where could they be going?

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:10.570
That's the direction of...

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:27.890
What?! A horde of Demoniacs?!

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:33.360
Yes, sir! Well over 30,000 in all!
They're heading straight for us!

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:36.560
What's Blue's post-recovery status?!

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.500
Currently conducting final checks!

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.040
- Have them hurry!
- Understood!

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.700
30,000?

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:56.420
There would be no reason for
Xargin-sama to lead the troops himself

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:59.690
just to destroy Zwolf headquarters.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:03.250
He could at least give
me an order to do something.

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:09.730
He doesn't entrust
everything to me as he did before.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:12.530
I guess this means he's disappointed in me,

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:18.140
even though there's no one
who can shake my loyalty to him...

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.250
Is something the matter?

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:31.120
No...

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:34.820
Zwolf must be in a wild panic right about now.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:38.550
They have no way of stopping this many.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:52.110
- How's that?
- Still no good.

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:54.010
I need to hurry!

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:58.350
With that many attacking, not
even Zwolf can avoid being destroyed!

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.380
I need to get Malek before then!

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:02.680
But this is a tough one.

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:08.460
You can't do it alone, and I'd be
attacked before I even got inside...

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:10.260
I wish we had a good plan...

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:15.330
You stay here. I'm doing this of my own accord.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.360
I can't drag you into it!

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.700
Let's quit acting like we're both strangers.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:29.080
Hermann...

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.710
Hermann!

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.770
I have an idea!

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:46.160
Mobilized Demoniacs will
arrive in approximately 10 minutes.

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:50.300
If Joseph isn't ready in time, then we go.

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.630
Understood.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:57.540
Surveillance video of the
Demoniacs has arrived. I'll play it.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.380
It's impressive that they've come this far.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:04.280
Maybe we should switch to cluster-type missiles.

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:06.350
Not at this distance.

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:10.180
We'd burn this entire area to a crisp.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:14.780
Xargin!

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:28.030
I never thought we'd meet again this soon!

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.830
I'm the one who changed you.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:40.910
And I changed too, to purify you...

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:45.910
Enough to even use my own brother...

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.900
Devil...

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:00.400
Joseph's fine-tuning is complete!

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:01.570
Excellent.

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:05.510
Send him out as soon as the
Demoniacs are within visual range.

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:07.610
Do not send anything else out!

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.180
Understood, sir!

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:12.370
Ready to go at any time.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:20.960
All we need is for either
Blue or Xargin to be defeated.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:23.930
After that, we wait for
the Isis to be completed...

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:26.930
Amanda Werner has returned
with Hermann in her custody.

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:28.660
What?!

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:32.060
She wants to know
where Hermann should be kept.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:38.070
- Ls B3-D empty?
- Yes.

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:42.980
Put him in there. Send
three Paladins just to be safe.

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:44.780
Understood.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:47.480
This is no time to deal with him!

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:55.590
He'll be held in B3-D. Wait
there until the Paladins arrive.

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:57.250
Roger.

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:11.430
Get in.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:28.790
What're you just standing
there for?! Go after him!

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.820
Hermann has escaped! He fled inside HQ!

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:39.770
That's absurd! What are you doing?!

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:41.740
I'm sorry, sir!

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:44.240
If he's inside, then it
should be easy to corner him!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.070
Use additional Paladins to capture him!

00:10:46.070 --> 00:10:47.680
Understood!

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:50.610
Damn you, wasting our time!

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:05.390
Just as I thought,
Malek's location is top-secret.

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:08.390
My only choice is to keep
looking while Hermann runs wild...

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:27.050
Damn it! Where are you, Malek?!

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:29.810
If we don't hurry up,
the horde of Demoniacs will!

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:53.470
They're here! We're completely surrounded!

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:59.140
Sending Joseph out!

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:07.820
Xargin-sama...

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:38.720
Have you found him, Hermann?!

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:43.160
No luck! There's a security lock on it!

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:50.490
We're already surrounded.
We need to find Malek now!

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:57.970
Amanda, now! Attack Hermann!

00:12:57.970 --> 00:12:59.460
Roger!

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:12.020
The act's over now!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:15.350
Yeah! Let's hurry and find Malek!

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:28.600
Huh? Was that a stroke
of good luck? Let's hurry!

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:30.090
Yeah...

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:37.270
It was almost like
someone did that on purpose...

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:54.250
Xargin... Joseph...

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:17.690
Huh? Why are they moving on their own?

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:24.520
Joseph. It looks like
you've finally risen near my level.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:27.290
So it was Joseph...

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:31.600
Xargin-sama came here to see for himself

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:35.160
that Joseph is already
able to control Demoniacs...

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:42.310
That is the power I desire.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:48.080
I can't give Xargin-sama
this level of fulfillment...

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:55.760
But there's a problem.
What do you think, Beatrice?

00:14:55.760 --> 00:15:06.770
Power is wonderful, but let me
see if his is actually of any use to you.

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:10.470
May I kill him when I deem him too weak?

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:16.030
Yes. If you can beat him,
then I have no need for him.

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:23.310
I've served at Xargin-sama's
side this entire time!

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:33.950
And I will continue to do so!

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:17.830
Joseph is fully unleashing his power...

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:28.580
Malek?!

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:30.310
This isn't the place!

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:50.900
I can beat him! I can beat him!

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:38.410
Dying...

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:42.690
I'm... dying...

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:49.590
Just like then...

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:25.460
That's far enough, Joseph.

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:44.020
Joseph. How many times must you disappoint me?

00:18:44.020 --> 00:18:52.490
What you've reached is nothing but
a false peak, using that foolish tool.

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:57.360
The fake power it has given
you has no meaning whatsoever!

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:05.830
Joseph!

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:34.630
Until you've attained true power,
we cannot settle the score between us.

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:38.630
Xar...

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:44.940
Xargin-sama...

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:48.870
Xargin-sama...

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:02.720
It's still too soon for you to die, Beatrice.

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:06.620
Xargin-sama...

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:20.610
Xargin... My sister...

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:28.520
Sasha... is alive!

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:17.830
Xargin...

00:21:54.170 --> 00:22:05.290
I dreamed of that day we chased shooting stars

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:15.700
What we had kept safe disappeared like sand

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:19.770
Just another illusion

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:28.870
Asleep, inside memories

00:22:30.110 --> 00:22:32.410
Wish for the stars

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:40.950
Holding countless wishes with both hands

00:22:40.950 --> 00:22:43.520
A wish for the stars

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:51.470
Quietly by your side, as you sleep

00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:57.100
Yes, right next to you

00:22:57.100 --> 00:23:03.080
Holding countless wishes

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:08.840
Yes, right beside you

00:23:12.220 --> 00:23:15.120
In days distant, they spoke of the same dream.

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:19.790
Now, in the shadows of that,
they take up arms and fight.

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:23.800
Episode 21: "Phantom Rider."

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:30.430
An unheard voice, or a bullet?
Only one can be chosen.
